<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no" ?>
<FinalDraft DocumentType="Script" Template="No" Version="2">

  <Content>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Fade in:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="1" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CHIP"></CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DAVID"></CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TOPANGA"></CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Alley way - Evening</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>TOPANGA is mindlessly walking along an alley, eyes glued to her SMARTPHONE. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The street is empty.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Suddenly DAVID runs past Topanga, stopping when he realizes who he’s just seen. He begins creeping up, attempting to verify if it’s her without her seeing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Topanga is lost to her smartphone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>David is certain it’s her, and grabs her in a bear hug. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>She SCREECHES.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Topanga looks back and suddenly realizes she’s seen her captor before.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Topanga</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You again?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>David lifts Topanga and begins carrying her towards the getaway vehicle.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>DavId</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Oh no Topanga! This is a GOOD kidnapping!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>In the distance, ALEC and CHIP are lounging on the getaway vehicle. The car doors are all wide open.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Chip notices David and Topanga approaching. He alerts Alec.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Chip</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The eunuch has the tart!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Chip and Alec scramble into the two front seats. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>David releases Topanga and begins straightening her clothes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Topanga is annoyed and slaps away David’s hands.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The two get in the car and slam the doors.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition">
      <Text>CUT TO:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="2 3/8" Page="2" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ALEC"></CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DAVID"></CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TOPANGA"></CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. Getaway Car - ContINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Chip is driving.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Alec</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Shit, we passed the In-n-out!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>David is staring intensely at Topanga as she is lost within her phone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Topanga feels David’s stare and looks up. Annoyed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>TopanGA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>What?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>David snaps out of his stare.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>DAVID</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Has anyone ever mentioned that you bear a striking resemblance to Mother Swift?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Topanga chews her gum and stares blankly.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>TOPANGA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Who?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>David is taken aback.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>DAVID</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Moth-  I mean, Taylor Swift. You know, pop princess, America’s sweetheart, secret underground cult leader?! </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>TOPANGA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Oh, yeah. I guess...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Topanga dismissively looks down at her phone as she finishes her sentence.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>David sneaks a look at Topanga’s phone. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>DAVID</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Are you tweeting?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>TOPANGA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Yeah, my followers are hungry for content. The WiFi at that resort sucked!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Just wait for my yelp review. It’s gonna be </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">scaaaaaathing</Text>
      <Text>....</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>David is shocked!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>DAVID</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Resort?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>We were just held against our will for MONTHS!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>TOPANGA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Yeah, but I lost seven pounds.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>DaVID</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I LOST MY BALLS!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Topanga does that lean-away-look-down-look-up lady-scoff move.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>TOPANGA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Sucks.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Topanga goes back to typing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>David tries about seven times to make a word.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>DAVID</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>They made me cut them off! FOR HER! Everyone had to! It was MANDATORY! The first thing they suggested: BALLS!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>What was your sacrifice?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Topanga looks up. Agitated.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>TOPANGA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I spent THREE WEEKS without my dry shampoo.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Topanga leans in and whispers, her eyes go wide.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>TOPANGA (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(sotto)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>It was horrible.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Topanga leans back and David’s eyes go wide. His mouth drops.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>David</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(sotto)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You weren’t affected at all.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Topanga goes back to looking at her phone. David squints as he thinks.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>DAVID (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>But how? How could this be?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Unless.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>His eyes light up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>DAVID (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You’re more powerful than Mother Swift.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(sotto)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The prophecy!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Alec (o.s.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You guys want a burger?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Fade to black</Text>
    </Paragraph>
  </Content>

